</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/bd01ea9e-b811-11f1-ac5b-41bcac5946c5/w:1024/p:16x9/Pope-adapt-thumbnail.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/bd01ea9e-b811-11f1-ac5b-41bcac5946c5/w:1024/p:16x9/Pope-adapt-thumbnail.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">15c21eb6-b811-11f1-8e16-159958fa63f9</guid><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 13:04:29 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Mass shooting at a house party in South Africa kills 11</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260924-mass-shooting-at-a-house-party-in-south-africa-kills-11</link><description>
